  "content": "<div>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><em><strong><span>日本城市城堡 江户</span></strong></em></span></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span>一座设定在江户时代的日本城市，拥有大型华丽城堡及周围的各种建筑。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span>地形从零开始重塑，并经过战略性布局以优化游戏体验。</span></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><em><strong><span>地图</span></strong></em></span></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span>以下是整个地图的图片，包括所有建筑，均在创造模式下查看。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_3dfb01f4-4a77-4e1b-b6cc-17935e862f50.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"447\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_96b8795e-4391-42e9-a3af-547b45c62313.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"447\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_e1cc81e3-36ba-4ee8-bc1f-77c3364c4a7f.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"447\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_57afab8d-350f-44bf-95f2-292efe602c10.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"447\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_c48c7b62-6c71-453a-b8c7-0520301b203f.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"447\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_a5f7df64-b17a-446c-a2ff-55b850adbada.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"447\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_da69c23a-f67f-4f44-81b7-3840b051f584.jpg\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_1f56309b-aea9-49d0-a47a-d768d8bdd408.jpg\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_899243b7-3dfa-4826-92e6-667d4d2c2e65.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"447\"></span></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><em><strong><span>更新</span></strong></em></span></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span>随着当前项目的完成，将陆续发布更新。</span></p>\n</div>",
